# Object (objectstore) and vector alignment (EG-DATAPLAT-VOCAB-R008.2).
#
# Each package-local term aligns to its data-platform term so the two cannot
# drift silently: classes `rdfs:subClassOf` (the package term is the emitted
# shape, the dp: term is the engine-side vocabulary), properties
# `owl:equivalentProperty`. Package terms live in the shared
# `http://knuckles.team/kg#` namespace.

@prefix dp: <http://knuckles.team/kg/data-platform#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix : <http://knuckles.team/kg#> .

# --- objectstore (objectstore-mcp, objectstore.ttl) ---

:ObjectStore rdfs:subClassOf dp:DataStore .
:Bucket rdfs:subClassOf dp:Bucket .
:Object rdfs:subClassOf dp:StoredObject .
:inStore owl:equivalentProperty dp:inStore .
:objectKey owl:equivalentProperty dp:objectKey .
:byteSize owl:equivalentProperty dp:byteSize .
:lastModified owl:equivalentProperty dp:lastModified .

# --- vector (vector-mcp, vector.ttl) ---

:VectorCollection rdfs:subClassOf dp:VectorCollection .
:embeddingModel owl:equivalentProperty dp:embeddingModel .
:dimensions owl:equivalentProperty dp:dimensions .
:distanceMetric owl:equivalentProperty dp:distanceMetric .
